OL,3,GDumfries, Galloway, Lothian & Borders
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FMostly dry
OL,6,Fthrough the evening with variable
OL,7,Fcloud and some bright then clear
OL,8,Fspells. Clouding over through the
OL,9,Fnight with outbreaks of rain, turning
OL,10,Fheavy at times in the west.
OL,11,
OL,12,CTuesday:FA cloudy and increasingly
OL,13,Fbreezy morning with occasionally heavy
OL,14,Frain. Staying mostly cloudy through
OL,15,Fthe afternoon with a few showers, but
OL,16,Fthe odd brighter spell possible.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
